        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"8fe193da-4f33-4213-a10d-d87cc39e96fe\",\"review_text\":\"The new update ruined everything for free users\"},{\"review_id\":\"b05e2afe-b837-46d6-b16a-bbadc2faebf8\",\"review_text\":\"De las mejores aplicaciones que se puede tener. Excelente.\"},{\"review_id\":\"97c57930-0ead-4e3c-96ad-efda13654871\",\"review_text\":\"We can't even go forward or backward of the lyrics . Very irritating at the beginning it was very good day by day the app is getting worse.\"},{\"review_id\":\"7a49ed0f-1912-4be4-be9c-d9d1000463b1\",\"review_text\":\"Disappointed\"},{\"review_id\":\"b34163fb-4fd2-4793-9923-1356a8e171a4\",\"review_text\":\"Nah you really went off with the audiobook thing. AMAZING Edit nevermind you gotta pay\"},{\"review_id\":\"5b56249c-8424-4dc5-998e-22cb62391f99\",\"review_text\":\"Worst App\"},{\"review_id\":\"61f70ee8-8156-4c7c-a9fc-e75d9ff0ecec\",\"review_text\":\"Stops playing in the middle of the song and then starts from beginning. Latest version of app Lattest version of android New samsung phone.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f6fd64f6-073f-4ce0-974d-7e293684b586\",\"review_text\":\"Using this app more time means it comes many ads inter between two songs so it more irritating\"},{\"review_id\":\"274ab85b-f1b0-4f6a-8be9-50765985768b\",\"review_text\":\"Ive really liked spotify especially when they finally added tool songs. There my favorite band\"},{\"review_id\":\"ff66a913-eea8-498b-841f-b19a8730f6fd\",\"review_text\":\"Nice music app\"}]}"
